(https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric, tag 0.160.4+26.3, commit
542047fffa4f49d96d4863d2c7abf0b508554f70,
fabric-convention-tags-v2/src/generated/resources), Apache License 2.0,
Copyright FabricMC. 24 of them are merged with Farmer's Delight's own file of
the same name (tools/carry_manifest.json, rule merge_fapi).
